# registry.yaml is generated by scripts/build-registry.sh. Each skill's rows depend only on that skill's
# files, so a clean text merge of two branches equals regenerating from the merged skills, and a conflict
# arises only when both branches change the same skill. Resolve a conflict by regenerating after the
# merge. No custom merge driver: a driver runs mid-merge, when only one side's skills are on disk.
# - linguist-generated: collapse it in GitHub diffs and exclude from language stats.
registry.yaml linguist-generated=true
